Population Distribution by Region
PNG is divided into 4 Regions. The Highlands Region (35.7%) has the highest percentage of PNG’s
population, followed by Momase (27%), then the Southern and Islands Regions.
Population Distribution by Province
At the provincial level, Morobe has the highest percentage (9.8%), followed by Eastern Highlands
Province (7 .9%), Madang (7 .5%) and National Capital District (7 .4%).

--- page 8 ----------------------------------------------------
Provincial Growth Rates
The fastest growing provinces (between 2011 and 2024) were Western, National Capital District,
Milne Bay, and Madang, each recording more than 3% average annual growth rate since 2011.
