This information was captured using a census questionnaire comprising of six questions; name, relationship
to head of household, sex, age, marital status and citizenship. The 2024 Census questionnaire was endorsed
by the National Census Steering Committee (NCSC) with the focus on ensuring the collection of high quality
census, instilling confidence in the accuracy and currency of the population count- a key government
      ...
census publicity drive.
Census Geography
The census geography is basically a register of all villages, communities, government or mission stations in
both urban and rural areas placed under their correct wards, LLGs, districts, and provinces. It is established
almost two years before the main census enumeration as a control to ensure everyone living in the country

